<div class="sub-hero"><div><span>RECURRING REVENUE</span><h2>Subscriptions & Plans</h2><p>Manage business packages, recurring billing, invoices, renewals and subscription revenue from a single financial dashboard.</p></div><div class="sub-hero-money"><small>Monthly Recurring Revenue</small><b>Rs <?=e(number_format($mrr,0))?></b><span>ARR Rs <?=e(number_format($arr,0))?></span></div></div>
